     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Cgvenkatesh,<div><br></div><div>There seems to be a problem with your Revolution R Open installation. The error message you indicate suggests you are running the R 3.1.2 engine, but RRO is currently built on R 3.1.1.</div><div><br></div><div>What platform are you running? Can you send us the output of sessionInfo()?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div># David Smith</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br clear=\"all\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\">-- <div>David M Smith &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">da...@revolutionanalytics.com</a>&gt;<br>Chief Community Officer, Revolution Analytics  <a href=\"http://blog.revolutionanalytics.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://blog.revolutionanalytics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242052888000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2y0z7G70JMlGFxxuQRB1go\">http://blog.revolutionanalytics.com</a><br>Tel: <a href=\"tel:(650)%20646-9523\" value=\"+16506469523\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+1 (650) 646-9523</a> (Chicago IL, USA)<div>Twitter: @revodavid</div><div><br></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
